Requirement 2
Create a kind cluster named argocd-perf using a configuration that exposes host ports 80, 443, and 30080, then install Argo CD into a dedicated namespace and confirm every Argo CD Deployment reaches the Available condition before proceeding.

cat > kind-config.yaml <<EOF
kind: Cluster
apiVersion: kind.x-k8s.io/v1alpha4
nodes:
- role: control-plane
  kubeadmConfigPatches:
  - |
    kind: InitConfiguration
    nodeRegistration:
      kubeletExtraArgs:
        node-labels: "ingress-ready=true"
  extraPortMappings:
  - containerPort: 80
